TITLE Calcite kinetics, pH2, 200C, Cu Ba, pe 4; pH at step 10
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2
    pe 4
    redox pe
    units mmol/kgw
    Cu 10
    Ba 5
    Cl 30
    -water 1

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0 1
        -m  1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -tol 1e-12
    -steps 10 in 100

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -time true
    -step true
    -pH true
END
